  "id": "dominican-1603-canon",
  "title": "Dominican Missal 1603: complete Canon constituent",
  "scope": "Complete Dominican Canon constituent as the 1603 book prints it: from p. 195 (canvas 265) display title CANON SACROSANCTI INCRUENTI SACRIFICII MISSAE and Te igitur through p. 198 (canvas 268) omnis honor et gloria, before the red heading Cantus Solemnis. 15 source-order units, 26 printed crosses, no rubrics printed within these bounds. The book sets the concluding Per omnia saecula saeculorum. Amen only in the following notated chant block, which is excluded with it. Whole-book and complete-Ordinary coverage remain partial; no wording is inherited from another edition.",
